ent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KVa0ZHLrgo4Q7kNvwGd7ukq&_nc_oc=AdqmwOsDrQkwbfT8_8j-4tytdKzQGZslv921sMVIGNVeDe865-8C1XJLJFjHhnyzAzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ_HBInNcUur_LdqxP-exRQ1wW4Vg7PWfrkzVES7C9YKQ&oe=6AB006A4"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7CKRci32ygQ7kNvwFQ5jpl&_nc_oc=AdqsXYvOhYJOy98OMj9uSuwB9VeeqUkaZR8qrxpt5gEbirDbS7qXzkJ8YaOIZwd_1VA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJCckPqtGZ0ivRfWUperfAKrmdf6R9KH9w0xofZPmwVwg&oe=6AAFE1D7"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1SSZhFz1k3QQ7kNvwEopnKT&_nc_oc=Adpu8YbEPFo9uqVV8TAXJi8Qi5OGJHi5Ci9zUyQbKAbdGPoJ_UsAeCLOaOikrNrUScI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJkE_BeKMBnw0DjeWEsLgQxzzS5KFnmKkJhK80_UV_xzA&oe=6AAFF8E2"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I-GnXpFmkIQQ7kNvwEJR736&_nc_oc=AdoU-TBUVVweOwhgEnx_FK-7G2xNWaBwMvzlD3lCmzAQBuyaVrG_1NtFwrT6GwVLJug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGo-nrvpq3n4z2uXrFO0ijx0ci3D9nKycCads9Fou_zA&oe=6AAFF3DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zombonk_MiB-1_Update_2560x1440.png", "id": "1613544100324720", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1613544103658053_3925064411389532973_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J-lJ5P8J-fYQ7kNvwFcH4p-&_nc_oc=Adohj5auxw-rB6KIPYp9CrcFha8bRMWq2rcNLgdm7P77t6GGI8TnSi8OTeDw_5Q-F0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIqbhhabL_RJHIo2k0-uzHql2xmF7CL7ibb-Aejb63SgA&oe=6AAFE155"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COM